---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | Hernandez Mercado Eye Clinic">
  <main class="legal-page container">
    <a class="auth-back-link" href="/">Back to clinic</a>
    <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Hernandez Mercado Eye Clinic respects your privacy. We collect information you provide when you register, request appointments, or contact the clinic so we can deliver and improve our services.</p>
    <h2>How we use information</h2>
    <p>Information is used to manage appointments, provide patient care, communicate clinic updates, and maintain secure account access. We do not sell personal information.</p>
    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>You may request updates to your account information or ask questions about how your information is handled by contacting the clinic directly.</p>
    <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: August 25, 2026</p>
  </main>
</Layout>
